Author: Eric Slud [aut], Tim Trudell [cre]
Maintainer: Tim Trudell <timtrudell@gmail.com>
Description: Provides functions to compute Successive Difference Replication (SDR) variances under stratified simple random sampling. Includes functions for calculation of permuted estimates and for arbitrary choice of D cycling parameter.
